sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Page or Component
    participant API as API Client
    participant MSW as MSW Handler
    participant Data as Mock Data

    User->>UI: Create a new task
    UI->>API: createTask(taskData)
    API->>API: Map camelCase payload to snake_case
    API->>MSW: POST /projects/:id/tasks

    MSW->>MSW: Validate request
    MSW->>MSW: Check authentication
    MSW->>MSW: Check project ownership
    MSW->>Data: Save new task

    Data-->>MSW: Created task
    MSW-->>API: 201 Created
    API->>API: Map snake_case response to camelCase
    API-->>UI: Return frontend task
    UI-->>User: Update task list